				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Use this form to apply for a Director’s Licence if you intend to act as director of a company by way of business (see s. 2.6 of the Company and Trust Services Providers Act).</p><p>Please complete all sections as fully as possible, giving reasons for noncompliance, if any, and attaching additional information where appropriate.</p>								</div>
