		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e4d3b0b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e4d3b0b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-00c34ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="00c34ad" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Guidelines</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a9a3fe0 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="a9a3fe0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
							<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<a href="https://www.vfsc.vu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Guidelines-on-PF-2026-CTSP.pdf" target="_blank">

												<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg aria-hidden="true" class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-play-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm115.7 272l-176 101c-15.8 8.8-35.7-2.5-35.7-21V152c0-18.4 19.8-29.8 35.7-21l176 107c16.4 9.2 16.4 32.9 0 42z"></path></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">Guidelines on PF 2026 - CTSP</span>
											</a>
									</li>
						</ul>
						</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9024d30 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="9024d30" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-791b621 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="791b621" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61159a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="61159a2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>A person or a company must not provide company services by way of business unless the person/company holds a license authorizing him or her to provide the service. For more information regarding company and trust service providers licensing please contact<strong> Mr. Thierry Wasinabani</strong> at <a href="mailto:twasinabani@vfsc.vu">twasinabani@vfsc.vu</a>.</p><p>You will find in the links below, a list of persons and entities licensed to provide companies services.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-df0c9a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="df0c9a9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">COMPANY &amp; TRUST SERVICE PROVIDERS LICENSE</h2>				</div>
				</div>
